Package: HW6
Type: Package
Title: Sparse Numeric Vector Class and Methods Using S4
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Parul", "Gupta",
           email = "parulg428@utexas.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description:
    Implements an S4 class 'sparse_numeric' for storing one-dimensional
    numeric vectors efficiently when many entries are zero. The package
    includes methods for arithmetic operations, coercion between dense and
    sparse formats, vector means, Euclidean norms, and standardization
    without expanding to a dense representation. Additional helper
    functions and unit tests illustrate proper use of S4 classes, generics,
    documentation, and testthat-based validation.
